Z||000048||TONY_C||09-10-2001||08:22 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Turbo88:<BR><B>Are these TH425 and Th325-4l transmissions rare in any way? How much can one expect to pay for one. My twin turbo LS1 project has found new life (outside an fbody  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Turbo88, you are in luck...I bought my TH425 from a guy in Oklahoma, he shipped it to me, it was a pretty reasonable price.  Contact Ken at East-West Auto Parts, he can hook u up with a tranny.<BR>||||reg||1
